android rc=0 (default fuzz, as librewolf-patches.py applies the lists); desktop rc=0. isolation-eme.patch and drm-permission-default.patch apply with no fuzz and no offset in the android run. Extra run with --fuzz=0 forced on every list: rc=1, failures only in common.txt patches, which librewolf-patches.py applies at patch's default fuzz (unchanged by this branch); there the one isolation-eme StaticPrefList.yaml hunk lands at offset -26 because those rejected common hunks are missing from the tree.
